Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "FoggyUrbanIntersection" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3, :risk4 ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 .

:weather1 a :FoggyCondition .

:risk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Reduced visibility due to fog obscuring vehicles and road features" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential collision risk due to limited visibility of vehicles ahead" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Increased risk of rear-end collision due to foggy conditions and traffic congestion" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:risk4 a :RoadConditionRisk ;
    :description "Potential risk of misjudging road conditions due to fog" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev4 .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Fog as an obstacle reducing visibility" .

:actor1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Green vehicle ahead in the right lane" .

:actor2 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Red vehicle on the right side of the scene" .

:actor3 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "White vehicle in the middle of the scene" .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.9"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.85"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.8"^^xsd:float .

:sev4 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

**Risk 1:**
Description: Reduced visibility due to fog obscuring vehicles and road features
Severity Score: 0.9

**Risk 2:**
Description: Potential collision risk due to limited visibility of vehicles ahead
Severity Score: 0.85

**Risk 3:**
Description: Increased risk of rear-end collision due to foggy conditions and traffic congestion
Severity Score: 0.8

**Risk 4:**
Description: Potential risk of misjudging road conditions due to fog
Severity Score: 0.75

The scene was classified as an **EvidenceBasedAnomaly** due to the foggy conditions providing clear evidence of reduced visibility, which affects the autonomous vehicle's ability to perceive and react to the environment.